 "title": "Property Tax Payment Options | Faribault County, MN",
 "text": "Property Tax Payment Options | Faribault County, MN\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nGovernment\nDepartments\nServices\nA-Z Index\nSearch\nACH Electronic Payments for Vendors\nElections & Voting\nCampaign Finance Reporting\nElection Calendar\nElection News\nElected Officials Map\nTownship Officers\nFee Schedule\nProperty Information by Parcel\nProperty Tax Payment Options\nProperty Tax Statements\nSplit/Combine Form\nTax Forfeiture Land Sale Information\nHome\nDepartments\nAuditor/Treasurer\nProperty Tax Payment Options\nProperty Tax Payment Options\nFaribault County offers several options for paying property taxes, and payments are accepted through the following:\nDrop Off at the Courthouse\nDropbox next to Door A in the NW corner of the Courthouse. Please DO NOT insert cash. The dropbox is for checks or money orders only. Secure items with a paperclip or envelope (provided inside door).\nAutomatic Payment\nTaxpayers have the opportunity to pay property taxes free of charge through an automatic withdrawal from a checking or savings account. Click here for the Authorization for Direct Payment of Property Taxes.\nMail\nMail a check or money order to: Faribault County Treasurer, PO Box 130, Blue Earth MN 56013.\nElectronically (for a minimal processing fee)\nMake a payment online: Online Payment of Property Tax . You will need your parcel number.\nMake a payment via telephone through Forte: 1-877-690-3729, Jurisdiction Code: 3328, You will need your parcel number and exact amount due.\nCounty Board\nEmployment\nMap & GIS Hub\nOnline Payments\nParks\nSheriff & Jail\n415 N Main Street, P.O. Box 130\nBlue Earth, MN 56013\nPhone: 507-526-6225\nHours: Monday through Friday, 8 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.\nMaps and Directions\nStaff Directories\nHome\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
